  "contract": [
    "Original Primordial Echoes 705572 triggers 547525 with the authored 40 percent chance only on Primordial",
    "Blast critical hits. Run 32 funded ordinary Primordial Blast casts, waiting 8500 milliseconds between",
    "them for the original eight-second cooldown and one-second global cooldown. Require an accepted cast and",
    "a new actual critical damage event for every trial, plus at least 32 native critical hits, an actual",
    "triggered echo and resolved rank-six 502827 damage on the same enemy. Zero procs after 32 eligible",
    "critical hits has probability at most 0.6^32, about 8e-8. Preserve the original proc chance, hit phase,",
    "critical-only filter, damage and cooldown; submitted casts rejected by the global cooldown are not",
    "trials."
  ],
